  dialogueSteps:
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Normal
    dialogueEN: Finally I got here.
    dialogueID: Akhirnya nyampe juga.
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Happy
    dialogueEN: This place hasn't changed much.
    dialogueID: Tempat ini gak banyak berubah
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Normal
    dialogueEN: Will Dad be surprised that I've suddenly arrived here?
    dialogueID: Ayah kaget gak ya aku tiba-tiba nyampe di sini?
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Happy
    dialogueEN: Can't wait to meet him.
    dialogueID: Gakk sabarnyaa ketemu Ayah
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Normal
    dialogueEN: I almost forgot, I need to let my friend know I've arrived.
    dialogueID: Ohya hampir lupa, aku harus ngabarin temenku kalau aku dah sampai.
